      <Value><![CDATA[A Norman cathedral with twin pyramidal west towers and a 13th-century chapter house famed for the Leaves of Southwell, some of the finest naturalistic stone carving in medieval Europe, set in the quiet Nottinghamshire market town of Southwell.]]></Value>
